To run neva's 'platoform bus emulator server' (emulator server
for short) just run the run_emulator_server.bash script to start
TestServer.

TestServer is supposed to provide emulated answers that it
was told to and basically serves static http emulator pages
and their js scripts which actually are neva emulator clients.

By default, TestServer is configured to serve on tcp/8888 port.
Thus, to run emulator client page just open
http://localhost:8888 in your browser.
